<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2th --- Māori NT converted from rtf (LAI); 20100830 zb</book>
  <para style="h">2 TEHARONIKA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ko te Pukapuka</para>
  <para style="mt">Tuarua</para>
  <para style="mt2">a Paora Āpōtoro ki te</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hunga o Teharonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Kupu Whakataki</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngā pōhēhē i manako­hia ki te hoki­nga mai o te Karaiti ka noho tonu hei pū­take whaka­raru i te hāhi ki Teharonika. <char style="bk">Te Puka­­puka Tuarua a Paora Āpōtoro ki te hunga o Teharonika</char> he whai­hanga i te whaka­­pono kua tae noa mai te rā hoki­nga mai o te Ariki. Ka whaka­tika a Paora i tēnei whaka­aro e mea ana i mua i te hoki­nga mai o te Karaiti ka rewa ake te tino kino ki tōna ike­ike i raro i tētahi kai­ārahi hanga­nga porehu e kīa nei ko “Te Tangata o te Hara” (2.3) koia e ātete ana i a te Karaiti.</para>
  <para style="ip">E whaka­tau­kī ana te Āpōtoro ko te mea nui mō ngā kai­pānui kia noho pūmau i roto i tā rātou whaka­pono ahakoa ngā whaka­raru me ngā mamae, kia whai mahi hei oranga tinana pērā i a Paora me āna hoa mahi, me te tohe i te mahi pai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Rāpopoto o Ngā Take</para>
  <para style="io1">Tīmatanga 1.1-2</para>
  <para style="io1">Te whakamoemiti me te whakamihi 1.3-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Ngā tohutohu mō te haerenga mai o te Karaiti 2.1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Whakahau ki te whanonga Karaitiana 3.1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Whakamutunga 3.16-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">He Mihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Nā Paora, nā rātou ko Hirawanu, ko Tīmoti –</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Ki te hāhi o te hunga o Teharonika i roto i te Atua, i tō tātou Matua, i te Ariki hoki, i a Īhu Karaiti:<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Kia tau ki a koutou te aroha noa me te rangi­mārie, he mea nā te Atua, nā tō tātou Matua, nā te Ariki hoki, nā Īhu Karaiti.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Te Whakawātanga i te Hokinga Mai o te Karaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />He tika rawa kia whaka­whetai mātou ki te Atua i ngā wā katoa mō koutou, e ōku tēina, he mea pai rā hoki ia, nō te mea e neke ake ana tō koutou whaka­pono, he nui rawa hoki te aroha o koutou katoa, o tētahi ki tētahi. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />I whaka­mana­mana ai mātou ki a koutou i roto i ngā hāhi a te Atua, ki tō koutou ū, ki tō koutou whaka­pono i ngā whaka­toi­nga katoa i a koutou, i ngā tūkino­tanga hoki e whaka­ririka kau nā koutou.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />He tohu tēnei mō te tika o tā te Atua whaka­wā, kia kīa ai koutou he tau mō te kīngi­tanga o te Atua, e mate nei koutou he whaka­aro ki tērā. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Me­he­mea ia he tika ki te Atua kia utua ki te kino te hunga e tūkino ana i a koutou; <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />ā, ki a koutou hoki e tūkino­tia nā, kia oki­oki tahi me mātou, i te whaka­kite­nga mai o te Ariki, o Īhu, i runga i te rangi me ngā ana­hera o tōna kaha, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />i roto i te mura ahi e rapu utu ana i te hunga kāhore e mātau ki te Atua, kāhore nei hoki e ngohe­ngohe ki te rongo­pai o tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Ko te utu hoki e whaka­pā­ngia ki a rātou he whaka­ngaro­manga, he mea mutunga­kore i te aro­aro anō o te Ariki, i te korōria anō hoki o tōna kaha. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Ina haere mai ia kia whaka­korōria­tia i roto i tāna hunga tapu, kia whaka­moe­miti­tia i roto i te hunga whaka­pono katoa i taua rā; i whaka­pono nā hoki koutou ki tā mātou whaka­atu i roto i a koutou.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Koia nei mātou ka īnoi tonu nei mō koutou, kia meinga koutou e tō tātou Atua he tau mō tēnei karanga­tanga, kia whaka­otia anō hoki e ia i runga i te kaha ngā mea katoa i āhua­reka ai tōna pai, me te mahi anō hoki o te whaka­pono, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />kia whaka­korōria­tia ai te ingoa o tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti, i roto i a koutou, me koutou hoki i roto i a ia, kia rite ai ki tā te aroha noa o tō tātou Atua, o te Ariki hoki, o Īhu Karaiti.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Te Mea Kino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Nā, he mea tēnei nā mātou ki a koutou, e ōku tēina, mō te taenga mai a tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti, mō tō tātou hui­hui­nga atu anō ki a ia; <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />kei hohoro te rurea o ō koutou hine­ngaro, kei oho­rere rānei i tā te wairua, i tā te kupu, i tā te puka­puka rānei e kīa ana nā mātou, e mea ana kua tae tonu mai ināia­nei te rā o te Ariki. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Kei tini­hanga­tia koutou i tētahi mea e te tangata. E kore hoki e tae wawe mai, kia mātua tae mai te taka­nga atu, kia whaka­kitea mai anō hoki te tangata o te hara, te tama a te whaka­ngaro. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />He hoa­riri nei ia, e whaka­kake ana i a ia ki runga ake i ngā mea katoa e kīa ana he Atua, e karakia­tia ana; kia noho ai ia i te whare tapu o te Atua, kia whaka­atu ai i a ia ko ia te Atua.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Kāhore rānei koutou e mahara i ahau anō i a koutou, i kōrero­tia e ahau ēnei mea ki a koutou? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Nā, ka mātau koutou ināia­nei ki te mea e ārai ana, kia whaka­kitea mai rā anō ia a tōna tāima. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Nō te mea kei te mahi ināia­nei te mea huna o te kino, otirā, tērā tētahi kei te ārai ināia­nei, kia whaka­wātea­tia rawa­tia anō ia. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ko reira whaka­kitea mai ai taua tangata kino, e whaka­ngaro­mia e te Ariki ki te hā o tōna māngai, e whaka­kāhore­tia ki te pu­tanga nui o tōna taenga mai. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Arā a ia pū, i rite nei tōna taenga mai ki te mahi­nga a Hātana, i runga i te mana, i ngā tohu, i ngā mere­kara teka, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />i ngā mahi tini­hanga katoa hoki o te hē, i roto i te hunga e whaka­ngaro­mia ana; nō te mea kīhai i riro i a rātou te aroha o te pono, kia ora ai rātou. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Mō konei hoki ka tukua atu e te Atua ki a rātou he pōhēhē e mahi ana, kia whaka­pono ai rātou ki te teka; <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />kia tukua ai ki te hē te hunga katoa kāhore i whaka­pono ki te pono, i āhua­reka kē ki te hē.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kua Whiriwhirihia Koutou mō te Ora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Tika tonu ia kia whaka­whetai atu mātou ki te Atua mō koutou i ngā wā katoa, e ōku tēina e aroha­ina nei e te Ariki, he mea whiri­whiri nā hoki koutou nā te Atua nō te tīma­tanga rā anō mō te ora, i runga i te whaka­tapu a te Wairua, i runga anō i te whaka­pono ki te pono. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Ko te mea tēnā i karanga­tia ai koutou e ia, he mea nā tō mātou rongo­pai, arā kia whi­whi ki te korōria o tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Heoi, e ōku tēina, e tū koutou; kia mau ki ngā whaka­rere­nga iho i whaka­akona ai koutou e te kupu, e tā mātou puka­puka rānei.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Nā, mā tō tātou Ariki, mā Īhu Karaiti pū anō, mā te Atua, mā tō tātou Matua, i aroha mai nei ki a tātou, i hōmai nei i te whaka­mārie mutunga­kore, me te mea pai e tūmanako­hia atu nei, he mea­tanga nā te aroha noa, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />māna e whaka­mārie ō koutou ngākau, māna koutou e whakaū ki runga ki ngā kupu, ki ngā mahi pai katoa.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Me Īnoi mō Mātou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Heoi, e ōku tēina, īnoi mō mātou, kia rere te kupu a te Ariki, kia whai korōria, kia pēnā me tēnā i a koutou; <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />kia whaka­ora­ngia hoki mātou i ngā tāngata pō­au­au, i ngā tāngata kino; kāhore hoki ngā tāngata katoa e whaka­pono.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Otiia, e pono ana te Atua, māna koutou e whakaū, e tiaki i te tangata kino. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Nā, e ū ana tō mātou whaka­aro i roto i te Ariki ki a koutou, kei te mahi koutou, ā, ka mahi anō i a mātou e whaka­ako nei ki a koutou.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Mā te Ariki hoki e whaka­tika ō koutou ngākau ki te aroha o te Atua, ki te ngākau āta tatari o te Karaiti.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Te Herenga kia Mahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Nā, ko tā mātou whaka­hau atu tēnei ki a koutou, e ōku tēina, i runga i te ingoa o tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti, mawehe kē i ngā tēina katoa e hē ana te whaka­haere, kāhore nei e rite ki ā mātou whaka­rere­nga iho i roto i a rātou. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />E mātau nā hoki koutou ki ngā mea e tika ai tā koutou whaka­rite ki a mātou; kīhai hoki i hē tā mātou whaka­haere i roto i a koutou; <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />kīhai hoki mātou i kai noa i te taro i te ringa o tētahi tangata, engari i roto i te mahi nui, i te uaua, me te mahi tonu i te ao, i te pō, kei whaka­tai­maha­tia e mātou tētahi o koutou. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Ehara rā i te mea kāhore ō mātou take, engari, kia meinga ai mātou hei tauira mō koutou, kia rite ai tā koutou ki tā mātou. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Anā hoki i a mātou e noho ana i a koutou, ko tā mātou whaka­hau tēnei ki a koutou, ki te kore tētahi e pai ki te mahi, kaua ia e tukua kia kai.<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Kei te rongo hoki mātou tērā ētahi e hē ana te whaka­haere i roto i a koutou, kāhore rawa e mahi, engari e poka­noa ana ki a ētahi. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Nā, ko tā mātou ako, ko tā mātou whaka­hau tēnei ki aua tāngata pērā, i roto i tō tātou Ariki, i a Īhu Karaiti, me mahi mārie rātou, ka kai i ā rātou nā ake kai.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ko koutou ia, e ōku tēina, kei ngākau­kore ki te mahi pai. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Nā, ki te kore tētahi e ngohe­ngohe ki tā mātou kupu i tēnei puka­puka, kia mārama te tohu i a ia, kei piri koutou ki a ia, kia whaka­mā ai ia. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Otiia, kaua e mea he hoa­riri ia, engari, whaka­tūpato­ria, ānō he teina.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poroporoaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Nā, mā te Ariki pū o te rangi­mārie e hoatu te rangi­mārie ki a koutou i ngā wā katoa, i ngā mea katoa. Kia noho te Ariki ki a koutou katoa.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Ko te oha āku, a Paora, nā tōku ringa­ringa ake, ko te tohu ia i ngā puka­puka katoa; he pēnā tāku tuhi­tuhi.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Kia tau te aroha noa o tō tātou Ariki, o Īhu Karaiti ki a koutou katoa.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>